   Iturbe, Ulises, Autonomous Univ State Hidalgo, Inst Basic Sci \& Engn, Biol Sect, Hidalgo, Mexico.
   Pereto, Juli, Univ Valencia, Dept Biochem \& Mol Biol, Valencia, Spain.
   Pereto, Juli, Univ Valencia, Cavanilles Inst Biodivers \& Evolutionary Biol, Valencia, Spain.},
DOI = {10.2436/20.1501.01.54},
ISSN = {1139-6709},
