   INTERACTIONS WITH MATERIALS AND ATOMS},
Year = {1996},
Volume = {117},
Number = {1-2},
Pages = {1-4},
Month = {AUG},
Abstract = {Absolute differential and total cross sections have been measured for
   the single electron capture of H+ in Mg at impact energies between 0.5
   to 5.0 keV and over the laboratory angular range -2 degrees to 2
   degrees. The total cross sections exhibit two maxima within the
   experimental energy range studied. The present values are compared with
   those from previous measurements and calculations, with which good
   agreement has been found.},
