   origin of life studies that merit review. We will discuss primitive
   atmospheres, submarine vents, autotrophic versus heterotrophic origin,
   the RNA and pre-RNA worlds, and the time required for life to arise and
   evolve to cyanobacteria. Topics such as prebiotic synthesis, template
   polymerizations, and evolution of specific metabolic pathways will not
