   PECTIN; GRIDSTED PROD; MERCK \& CO, KELCO DIV; MAROKAGAR; PROTAN
   BIOPOLYM; QUEST BIOCON; SANOFI BIO IND},
Abstract = {We present the results of a floristic study of intertidal species of
   Gelidiaceae collected in ten localities in the Bahia de Banderas region.
   The study area is within an extensive overlapping transitional zone
   between the tropical and subtropical regions of the Mexican Pacific
   coast. Species of the genera Gelidium and Pterocladia were found, G.
   microdentatum and G. pusillum being the most abundant and widely
   distributed in the Bay. The local and Mexican Pacific distribution for
   each species is given. The number of species found in this study is
   compared with the numbers reported in the literature for the Mexican
   Pacific.},
