   deduced by Argos (1988) were tested in a set of 53 putative reverse
   transcriptases (RTs) sequences. Since it was found that some of these
   rules are not followed by RTs coded by bacteria, group II introns, and
   non-LTR retrotransposons, we present here a more strict definition of
   the Asp-Asp domain.},
