   OF ACADEMIC LABOUR, UNIV NACL AUTONOMA MEXICO, MEXICO, AUG 15-16, 1991},
Abstract = {A renormalization-group analysis of the long-time and long-distance
   behaviour of the diffusion in an environment with a quenched random
   drift force is carried out. The diffusion is characterized by an
