Abstract = {It is proved that the number of semikernels (quasi kernels) of a digraph
   D is less than or equal to the number of semikernels (quasi kernels) of
   its line digraph L(D).  It is also proved that the number of Grundy
   functions of D is equal to the number of Grundy functions of its line
   digraph L(D) (in the case where every vertex of D has indegree at least
   one).},
