Abstract = {In the leaf extracts of Jatropha elbae Jimenez Ramirez, J. malacophylla
   Stand, J. tlalcozotitlanensis Jimenez Ramirez and J. galvani Jimenez et
   Contreras, an evaluation of the main groups of secondary metabolites was
   carried out and their chromatographic profiles were determined.
   In the four species, alkaloids, flavonoids, terpenes and steroids, and
   glycosides were detected.  Saponines were only found in J:  galvani. the
   coefficients of association of the species were calculated from their
   chromatographic profiles and a pattern of similitude was established
